<title>FINLAND: Fiskars H1 profit up to FIM 139 mln.</title>
<headline>Fiskars H1 profit up to FIM 139 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30,</p>
<p>	   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinaries	    139 vs 122</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	    11.40 vs 10.90</p>
<p> Net sales				    1,096 vs 1,206</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts mean forecast was for a 110 million markka first-half profit before extraordinaries.</p>
